@startuml
title L2-043 - Provide clear navigation and recoverable states
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #344054
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #344054
  FontColor #101828
}
skinparam package {
  BorderColor #667085
  FontColor #101828
  BackgroundColor #F9FAFB
}

actor "Owner / release reviewer" as actor
box "Frontend - Loupe application" #E0F2FE
participant "LibraryShell" as page
participant "EditorDraft" as entity
end box
box "Frontend - Loupe components / api contracts" #E0F2FE
participant "View / interface-bound service or test harness" as client
end box
note over page, client : Local interaction; feature services use their documented API slices
actor -> page : Start workflow / review
page -> entity : Request navigation with current draft [L2-043]
alt unsaved edit
entity --> page : Keep editing / Discard choice
else permitted navigation
page -> client : Load destination with retained filters
client --> page : Loading / empty / populated / retryable failure
end
note over entity : Expiry preserves same-tab draft only for same returning owner
page --> actor : accessible destination or retained draft
@enduml
